    "body": "The prior shared Generate coefficient pass lowered native loss without correcting new entries. This change tests its declared geometric successor: one globally shared token/lane/code replacement across all 588 frozen failed/protected terms, using exact finite-H4 conditionals and complete Generate/physical-Copy pooling.\n\nThe executed 1,920-triple census includes 16 no-ops and finds 483 interventions preserving all 84 protected winners while correcting at least one failed entry. No triple strictly lowers the fixed combined CE. The minimum-loss positive changes token 617/lane 0 from 58 to 48, corrects entry 391, and raises combined CE from 8.52634374894637 to 8.634086267334682. This is exposed development diagnostic evidence; no candidate, optimizer or complete-reply/chat gain is qualified.\n\nAdds a revision/identity-bound staged token-mass accessor and a standalone exclusively claimed/sealed diagnostic. Actual capture matches 588 saved objective states and 84 complete protected pools. Replacements are shared across every row; changed clipped references use authoritative full reduction. Outputs retain every baseline pool, conditional and candidate decision.\n\nExecuted validation at source `2d88376250` on the admitted own pod:\n\n- Formatting, pending-mass test (1), cache tests (5), factual conditional test (1), and optimized example build pass with zero failures or ignored tests.\n- Mathematical and adversarial exact-source reviews pass.\n- Independent saved-evidence audit recomputes 1,128,960 finite scores and integer patches, 9,408 current-code controls and 909 reference replicas; passes in 177.673982s.\n- Four Rust complete-file BLAKE3 seals pass in 53.008009s.\n- Producer pre-seal time is 114.462879s; supervisor 180.565744s; peak RSS 209,332 KiB. Reader pin correction and two wrapper setup failures are retained. No model rerun occurred.\n\nRuntime is preserved at private HF revision `12b29a95ca66b1a17827d0c89fd77e8a3b21cca1`. Full result, readers, logs and telemetry are preserved at revision `2696294a31af05b5d3ab6a85066e27a5f172aa5e`, prefix `codex/sol-prototype/prototype-0001-2d88376250`; all uploaded files were freshly downloaded and SHA verified.\n\nCurrent state and the structured receipt record one falsifiable successor: fix the selected prototype, take fresh coefficient credit, rebuild incidence, preserve the original 84 plus gained entry 391, and require final CE below the original emission baseline before exact reload and actual own-prefix evaluation. No alternate-witness fit bank or unchanged coefficient refill is authorized by this result. Final exact-head checks and reviews are posted before queueing.\n\nReferences #820.\n",
